        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Julian Nott\n- Products: Wallace & Gromit films, Peppa Pig, Wallace & Gromit's Musical Marvels\n- Organizations: Astley Baker Davies, Entertainment One, BBC Proms\n- Events: 2012 season of The BBC Proms\n\nFacts:\n- Peppa Pig is a British preschool animated television series that originally aired on 31 May 2004.\n- Peppa Pig was directed and produced by Astley Baker Davies in association with Entertainment One.\n- Julian Nott is best known for his work on the Wallace & Gromit films and Peppa Pig animations.\n- Wallace & Gromit's Musical Marvels, also known as Wallace & Gromit at the Proms, is Prom 20 of the 2012 season of The BBC Proms.\n- Wallace & Gromit's Musical Marvels features orchestral renditions of Julian Nott's Wallace & Gromit theme and classical music set to scenes from the Wallace & Gromit films.",
